arc-plc/oklahoma/beckham-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids shows November to December 2025 at 20% of normal and January to February 2025 at 25%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 42% and April to May at 43% on that same middle. Since 1951, April to May and November to December each landed under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle. Grid 18421 had its driest year in 1956 at 47%.</p>"}
